WEBVTT

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:08.580
The third prince, Bruno. Sixteen years old.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:12.730
From a young age, he has been lauded
as a genius with a brilliant mind.

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:14.940
This prince possesses an
extraordinary intellect.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:18.110
He has presented many papers,
and is a burgeoning young scholar

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:21.870
in the fields of sociology and philosophy.

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:25.080
I do not have time to deal with you.

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:01.220
Enter.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:07.230
The Prince Interviews

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:05.060
Welcome, Royal Tutor.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.550
Have a seat.

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:13.610
What an immaculate room.

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:17.100
My last interview was an uphill battle.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:24.170
Will this prince agree to take my test?

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:27.860
So? What do you want me to do?

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:31.550
I'd like you to take a competency test.

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:33.070
Understood.

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:35.610
That went disturbingly smoothly.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:36.950
Here. I've finished it.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:40.600
And too quickly.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:44.800
With all due respect, I should like to
put your abilities to the test as well.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.070
To the test?

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:50.090
To assess the caliber of a royal
tutor who hasn't gone to university.

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:54.720
All of our tutors thus far have
been less intelligent than I.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:58.870
I ask that you leave this post immediately
if you prove to be no different.

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:08.400
I would do well to be cautious as I build
trust with him, given his intelligence.

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:10.560
I should decline his test.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:13.620
Also, I'm concerned.

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:18.340
I never imagined the new royal
tutor would be this small.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:18.790
Small!

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:22.010
I accept your challenge. Have at me!

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:28.000
You must be relatively learned for
the palace to employ you at all.

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:30.470
Our duel of the minds will be through chess.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:34.270
One can see their opponent's
level of intelligence,

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:36.860
thought process, and personality all
through their moves on the chessboard.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:39.370
I've never lost a match.

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:41.040
I hope you're prepared for a challenge.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:43.020
Just the way I like it.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:54.530
I-Impossible...

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:56.240
Checkmate.

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:57.670
How did I lose?

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:02.210
This ended up like this,
and this like this, and that...

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:04.360
Are you quite satisfied?

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.370
Then I should be on my—

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:06.920
Next! On to the next test!

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:09.140
What? You have more? Laze.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:09.350
Laze

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:12.220
Don't relax yet. Are you serious about this?

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:15.880
Could this tutor be an exception?

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.540
No, it's too soon to say.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:21.350
I'll test him with less conventional means.

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:25.630
It seems Prince Bruno
is something of a pain.

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:28.120
I challenge you to mental arithmetic.

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:31.530
I've finished.

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:32.070
What?!

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:34.820
You could have written in random numbers.

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:37.120
It's all correct!

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:42.070
A royal tutor must also
have knowledge of music.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:45.960
What?!

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:48.620
A royal tutor must also have luck.

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:50.600
I challenge you to a game of cards.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:53.560
A royal straight flush.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.760
This goes beyond brilliance.

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:59.480
What is going on here?

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:02.430
What will the next challenge be?

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:06.310
A five-tier tower while I was thinking?
How easy is this for you?

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:11.330
My papers have been praised by scholars
the world over. How can I be...

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:15.050
No, keep it together.
Be proud of your intelligence!

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:17.300
You won't lose to anyone in
pure academic knowledge.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:22.000
Pardon me, but you've been
speaking your thoughts aloud.

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:26.510
Next, I'll have you take
a test I created myself.

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.090
I need only finish this?

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:30.470
One hundred difficult questions
covering the fields of

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:32.720
mathematics, chemistry,
history, geography and more.

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:36.510
What's more, I wrote them
in five random languages.

00:05:36.510 --> 00:05:38.720
Even you will have a hard time with—

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:39.580
I've finished.

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:45.580
It's all correct.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.910
By the way, I found one misspelling

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:53.300
in the language of Fonsein
in question fifty-seven.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:54.820
I marked it in red for you.

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:58.010
Are you quite all right?

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.310
It's no use.

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.240
I have no hope of besting him.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.710
His raw ability is overwhelming.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:06.270
He can even draw out powerful luck.

00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:09.100
Is this what a true genius is like?

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:13.070
From a young age, I was highly competitive.

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:16.680
Academics, culture, even music...

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:21.520
I threw myself at it all to
distinguish myself, and yet...

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.110
What do I have to show for it...?

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:30.810
Oh? Is this Your Highness's writing?

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:32.880
Y-Yes...

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:35.650
May I read it?

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:36.910
Do whatever you want.

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:44.740
I see. Regarding the Kingdom of Granzreich's
basic principles as a modern nation...

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:49.760
You even mention the effects
of the recent construction

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.340
of a ring road on the
public consciousness...

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:53.150
Excellent.

00:06:56.330 --> 00:07:00.360
You can tell which point
I poured my efforts into?

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:05.860
Indeed. This is a truly level-headed
perspective... That of a scholar, not a royal.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:09.530
But this sentence could be
misinterpreted as blaming

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:13.240
the banks for the economic
crisis thirty years ago.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.670
You might wish to compose it
carefully to be more delicate.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:20.610
You're right.

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:24.120
It's a minor part, but it lacks subtlety...

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:28.130
Also, regarding your account
of harmony among the commoners,

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:32.910
perhaps the public operettas at
Karl Theater also proved helpful?

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:34.970
I-I hadn't considered that.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:39.930
While it might be outside
your field to a degree,

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:42.350
taking the arts into consideration
will broaden your viewpoint.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:46.400
Incredible. I can't believe
there's someone who understands

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:49.650
my writing so well, and can
give me such useful advice.

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:52.320
This is... This is...

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:54.630
Master!

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:55.520
Master?

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:57.550
Please let me call you my master!

00:07:58.390 --> 00:08:01.400
Um, I am the royal tutor...

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:05.930
Forgive me. I got too excited.

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:10.790
Master, you are the person most
deserving of respect in my life.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:13.380
Your Highness, please lift your head.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:22.140
Master  Master
Master  Master

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:16.700
I admit my complete defeat.

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:21.110
I look forward to your guidance,

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:22.140
Master!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.560
A strange kind of attachment...

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:27.770
Prince Bruno said he was testing me,

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:34.700
but perhaps he was only looking for
someone he could truly see as a teacher.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.300
Master!

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.860
But... Master?

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:39.650
You still have much to learn.

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:42.080
Put your back into it, Bruno!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:43.870
Yes, Master!

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:45.890
It sounds like an apprenticeship.

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:50.120
While I am glad to have your respect,
"Master" is too embarrassing.

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:53.510
Please call me "Professor,"
as I am the royal tutor.

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:57.750
Forgive me. You're quite right.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:01.040
Then I will consider you my master
in my heart, but call you Professor.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:03.130
Please stray away from "Master."

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:06.320
But "Master" feels more correct.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:10.120
If I were to express my heartfelt
enthusiasm to study under you as X,

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:12.670
and the nuances of the
word "professor" as Y,

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:14.240
Excuse me, but you've lost me.

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:14.240
this is this and that is that and...

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.480
Please, Master—

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:17.860
Bruni!

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:22.950
Licht! How many times have I told you
to knock on my door three times?

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:25.470
What's the big deal? We're brothers.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:27.380
Professor, is your interview all done?

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:27.870
Yes.

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:28.620
Huh?

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:32.660
I will see you in the reception
hall at four o'clock.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.590
As it is our first time,

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:38.890
I will only begin your lesson if I
am able to gather you all together.

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:41.300
Only if we all assemble there?

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:47.910
Yes. His Majesty the King instructed me
to give all four of you equal attention.

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:50.840
Okay. Bruni, I'm taking the professor.

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.640
I'm not done speaking with Master!

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:54.400
Run away!

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.140
Master!

00:09:56.620 --> 00:10:00.970
Not the most comfortable position,
yet I'm a tad thankful.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.550
He certainly is a pain.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:08.920
The fifth prince, Licht. Fourteen years old.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:11.500
He has handsome features,
a cheerful personality,

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:14.670
and deep intimacy with
royals from other nations.

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:20.190
He often visits the city in secret and is
popular with the people, particularly women.

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:23.420
Or so my research would lead me to believe.

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:27.570
You can come into my room, Professor!

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:31.270
I should lecture him on how to carry a tutor.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:33.770
Everybody! I brought the professor!

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:34.450
Everybody?

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:37.260
This is the child professor
you were talking about?

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:39.480
He's so cute. I want to pet him.

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:44.330
Child? Well, sometimes being
mistaken for a child isn't so bad.

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:43.040
He's so cute!

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.010
Oh, dear. What was I
going to lecture him for?

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:53.000
Sorry about that. When I mentioned you,
they all begged to see you.

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:55.550
Who are these young women?

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:56.960
They're my friends.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.600
<i>Just</i> friends?

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:02.970
If you're going to say such sad things,
maybe we'll go back to the city.

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:06.820
You're my super special friends, of course.

00:11:06.820 --> 00:11:11.020
Don't go. Dote on me more.

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:15.210
I'll dote on you so much, Prince.

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:15.210
<i>I see.</i>

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:19.460
<i>The research notes about
him often visiting the city...</i>

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:24.040
<i>Meant that he often went there
to flirt with women.</i>

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:27.750
I would like to meet with
Prince Licht privately.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:30.870
Would you please give us a moment?

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.860
Heine darling, that's so cold.

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:33.670
Heine darling?

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:36.370
Sorry. Pretty please?

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:38.210
If you want us to, Your Highness.

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.150
See you later!

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:41.530
Okay!

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:42.500
<i>He's surprisingly cooperative.</i>

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:46.310
I apologize for interrupting your fun.

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:47.720
No biggie.

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:52.150
I wanted to catch you alone to ask
some questions of my own, too.

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:54.130
C-Could he mean...

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:58.110
Professor, you look like a kid,
but you're fully grown, right?

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:00.970
So what's going on down there?

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:05.560
Hey! Professor!

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:08.320
How is it okay for a teacher
to kick a student?!

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:10.030
It was an educational measure.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:13.650
What's your problem?
It was innocent curiosity.

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:15.040
Boo! Boo!

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:15.030
How was that innocent?

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:18.680
Anyway, could you take this
competency test? Here.

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:20.950
Huh? Are you being mean all of a sudden?

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:22.550
I'm a prince, remember?

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:27.200
A competency test, huh? Do I have to?

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.550
What a bother.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:34.470
Bother... bother... bother...

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:39.570
Say, do you ladies know
the answer to this question?

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.780
Which one?

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:41.170
Let me see.

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:45.440
Your competency is not
a group effort. Do it yourself.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:49.420
You're so hard to please.
Fine, fine, I'll be serious.

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.140
How patronizing.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:56.680
Oh, yeah. Did you talk to Leo
and Bruni? Aren't they loons?

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:59.150
Leo's, like, stupid strong.

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:00.670
Oh, you have to hear this.

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:04.380
We had this important dinner party,
right? So guess what Leo did.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:06.640
He tried so hard to wrap his head
around some complicated paper

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:08.890
Bruni was talking about that he got a fever.

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:11.560
Ahem. Please stop chatting
and take your test.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.650
But it's already done. Yay!

00:13:14.650 --> 00:13:15.440
My word.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:18.510
Once you began, you finished
it in no time at all.

00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:21.500
Yup! People are always telling me
I can do anything if I try.

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:24.060
Then it would behoove you to
try seriously from the start.

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:26.890
I would honestly like to
get my wasted time back.

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:28.260
Scolded...

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:31.740
Now, I have another prince to see.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:34.760
Ah! Not so fast! I've got a question.

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:39.340
What is it? I will not answer
your earlier question.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:42.270
Uh, I <i>do</i> wanna ask that... But no.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.630
So like, seriously, Professor...

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:46.900
Who are you?

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:52.430
What do you mean?

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:58.060
Like, all the other royal tutors were famous
people with titles like Professor So-and-so.

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:01.170
You have to be in order
to get called to the palace.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:05.520
But Heine Wittgenstein? Never heard of him.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:10.190
So did you get the post through
Father personally...?

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:14.300
A sharp, searching gaze...

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:17.820
Well, not that I know the
names of any professors.

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:23.480
Oh, sorry. I'm sure you're some famous
scholar who won some award or something.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:27.120
My bad. I don't care about that stuff,
so I wouldn't know.

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:30.230
Prince? Is your talk done yet?

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:33.920
What's the matter? You look all serious.

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:34.700
It is nothing.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:39.870
We were having a serious talk.
Right, Professor?

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:46.220
It was about this and that...
His adult problems.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:46.930
You need a lesson.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:46.930
Owie!

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:47.980
Squee!

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:50.880
Now then, I will see you at four
o'clock in the reception hall.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:54.200
We'll only have lessons if
all four of us show up, right?

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:59.490
What happens if we don't?

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:02.210
I'm a busy guy, after all!

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:04.090
Excuse me.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.770
Bye-bye, Heine darling!

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.950
If I let my guard down because
he is the youngest prince,

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:25.620
he may pull the rug out from under me.

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:29.060
Prince Licht is not to be taken lightly.

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:34.030
Excuse me. I'm here to change the sheets.

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:47.330
Now, to collect myself.
Only Prince Kai remains.

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:51.690
The second prince of Granzreich.
Kai, seventeen years old.

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:55.540
A boy of few words who
rarely appears in public.

00:15:55.940 --> 00:16:00.150
After a violent episode at military
academy, he was suspended.

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:02.350
He is famous for his violent temper.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.490
Is Prince Kai in his room?

00:16:08.490 --> 00:16:11.690
Huh?! Um, His Highness left a moment ago.

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:14.290
Do you know which way His Highness went?

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:17.280
I'm sorry. I don't know.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:20.370
If I may ask, what kind
of person is Prince Kai?

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:20.950
Huh?

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:24.870
Any details will do. What sorts of
things does His Highness talk about?

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:30.080
I-I don't know. I'm afraid I could never
make conversation with Prince Kai.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.480
Excuse me!

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:36.910
It seems he is quite feared.

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:40.240
This is a pickle...

00:16:40.240 --> 00:16:43.010
Only one more hour until my
appointment with the princes.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:46.000
I need to find Prince Kai quickly.

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:50.390
I must hurry.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:54.420
Punctuality is the first
step to building trust.

00:16:54.420 --> 00:16:55.150
Hmm?

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:57.840
Oh? Is that the palace dog?

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:05.640
Please return my file, doggie.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:12.280
A dead body in the palace courtyard?

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:19.230
No. This boy is sleeping.

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:25.520
I've found Prince Kai,
the most dangerous of the princes.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.860
Get... lo...

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:31.110
He told me to get lost, didn't he?

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:34.270
It would seem he is hostile toward me.

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:37.160
How shall I handle him?

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:47.980
Soft. Soft...

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:48.880
Rub

00:17:49.350 --> 00:17:50.980
Oops.

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:55.220
Rub

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:54.950
Oops? Did he mean to grab the dog?

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:59.220
New... teacher...

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:02.690
So he already considers me his teacher.

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:05.490
Perhaps I needn't be cautious.

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:08.470
Good day. An afternoon nap, Your Highness?

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:12.230
I like it here.

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:14.480
It is rather tranquil.

00:18:15.060 --> 00:18:16.110
Shadow.

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:16.910
Pardon?

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:18.660
Shadow's a good dog.

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:23.120
I take it Shadow is this dog's name?

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:26.510
I play here with Shadow all the time.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:36.600
A stark difference from my research.

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:39.060
Then why does he have such
a notorious reputation?

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:43.970
Professor. That cloud...

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:46.330
looks like an apple.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:47.580
Q-Quite.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:50.530
Were you glaring at me, just now?

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:57.400
Your Highness, are you ever assumed
to be glaring when you aren't,

00:18:57.400 --> 00:19:00.360
due to your naturally sharp eyes?

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:02.080
All the time.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:05.110
As I suspected. You do
not correct the mixup?

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:09.800
I've always looked like this.
And I'm not a good talker.

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:15.030
After a bad first impression,
getting along won't happen.

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:16.370
Prince...

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:21.980
By the by, why are you touching my hands?

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:23.000
Soft.

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:23.630
Soft?

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:26.690
I like soft things.

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:29.590
Your hands are soft...

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:32.180
Shadow's soft, too.

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:35.020
Professor and Shadow... soft...

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:37.150
Now I'm being compared to a dog's paws...

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:38.660
Professor.

00:19:39.210 --> 00:19:41.520
Is that test for me?

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:44.030
Ah, yes. Please complete this.

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:52.820
Like this, he does not look like a
prince anyone would be afraid of.

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:54.080
Get... lo...

00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:58.370
Prof... along...

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:02.290
Professor... Hope we'll get along...

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:07.470
I see now that you didn't glare at me,

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.930
and are not hostile
toward me either, Prince Kai.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:12.530
Shadow! Shadow!

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:15.200
There you are!

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:17.900
Don't run off, you silly thing.

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:20.460
I believe she is...

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:23.810
This is our little sister.

00:20:23.810 --> 00:20:26.620
Say hello to the new teacher.

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:30.650
How do you do? I'm Adele.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:33.430
It is a pleasure to make your
acquaintance, Princess Adele.

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:36.280
I am the royal tutor, Heine.

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:38.250
Adele's a good girl.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.570
And Shadow?

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:41.320
Shadow's a good dog.

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:47.840
His gaze is actually very gentle.

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:49.460
Princess!

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:50.960
Princess?

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:51.970
They're calling for you.

00:20:52.290 --> 00:20:55.710
Okay! See you again, Professor Heine.

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:58.870
Professor.

00:20:58.870 --> 00:20:59.480
Yes?

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:04.550
I like you.

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:10.000
You're the first teacher to talk
to me... makes me happy.

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:12.090
Prince Kai...

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:19.580
Professor... my brothers
and I... are in your care.

00:21:19.580 --> 00:21:20.500
And I in yours.

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:24.170
Please be in the reception hall at four.

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:27.890
Today's lesson will begin only if
all four of you are assembled.

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:30.200
He's asleep.

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:32.520
Prince Kai...

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:37.360
He was as mature and gentle as one
would expect from a second prince.

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:39.880
I wrongly assumed he would
be the most trouble.

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:49.940
Second-hand information is unreliable.

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:52.820
Let this be a lesson to me!

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:57.460
Instead of judging others based
on rumors and gossip articles,

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.370
I must look and feel for myself.

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:02.430
You cannot know anyone without
coming face-to-face with them.

00:22:03.910 --> 00:22:07.080
I must start over from scratch.

00:23:39.710 --> 00:23:42.330
Shadow's a good dog. Pet, pet.

00:23:42.330 --> 00:23:44.450
You really love petting things, Kai.

00:23:44.450 --> 00:23:46.460
Cuddles are important.

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:49.280
Next time, "You Don't Need to Accept Me."

00:23:48.190 --> 00:23:53.860
You Don't Need to Accept Me

00:23:48.190 --> 00:23:53.860
Next Time:

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:52.740
Bruno's a good boy, too. Can I pat you?

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:54.740
Why are you patting me, too?!
